{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":333529,\"title\":\"The Adventure Zone: Balance\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Justin, Travis, and Griffin McElroy have recruited their dad Clint for a campaign of high adventure. Join the McElroys as they find their fortune and slay an unconscionable number of - you know, kobolds or whatever in - The Adventure Zone. The Balance Arc focuses on a trio of adventurers named Taako, Merle, and Magnus, who, following the first arc, work for an organization called the Bureau of Balance, led by a mysterious director. Their job is to find and retrieve powerful and ancient relics that, in the wrong hands, could potentially destroy the world. During their adventures, they meet a boy detective, fight ghost-possessed robots, and discover the true meaning of friendship (as well as a reality destroying horror).\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x4hwR02haXP8rZmO06VfYj8Y3Yn.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":null,\"youtubeBackdrop\":\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/bHN-n1r5Zj4/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2014,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Action & Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":16,\"totalEpisodes\":96,\"createdBy\":[\"Griffin McElroy\",\"Justin McElroy\",\"Travis McElroy\",\"Clint McElroy\"],\"networks\":[],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"US\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2026-04-17\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1759609,\"name\":\"Justin McElroy\",\"character\":\"Taako\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/veBMrYHbiuW4kqwcu45ckmVpf0q.jpg\"},{\"id\":1759610,\"name\":\"Travis McElroy\",\"character\":\"Magnus Burnsides\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9ORj8D1qazEqLzcrCSUK1JJ6S2u.jpg\"},{\"id\":2683324,\"name\":\"Clint McElroy\",\"character\":\"Merle Highchurch\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zXMaSEMikhfaMpfolz44zWIaAr8.jpg\"},{\"id\":1759613,\"name\":\"Griffin McElroy\",\"character\":\"Dungeon Master\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7EaVv4Du1bjTSgCyRmJGxxNVH5X.jpg\"},{\"id\":2955020,\"name\":\"Stuart Wellington\",\"character\":\"Brad Bradson\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/t5yAPrDoAZp156VxkoeldbRXlSa.jpg\"},{\"id\":1230192,\"name\":\"Elliott Kalan\",\"character\":\"Jeremy Fangbattle\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a2cRVV8cARkGSShsHeFMtvMCr2x.jpg\"},{\"id\":4256330,\"name\":\"Dan McCoy\",\"character\":\"Lucian Buttwatcher\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5683087,\"name\":\"Zhubin Parang\",\"character\":\"Tanzer Silverview\",\"photo\":null}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"bHN-n1r5Zj4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"IVzYVfnxjdg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"wniyd26r7As\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[],\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Murder on the Rockport Limited\",\"seasonOverview\":\"It's a train based adventure! Imagine Murder on the Orient Express (only with infinitely more Juicy Wizards and technicolor bowties).\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x4hwR02haXP8rZmO06VfYj8Y3Yn.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2015-03-19\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Chapter One\",\"overview\":\"Our heroes are sent out on their first mission as Reclaimers for the Bureau of Balance. Their initial task is an impossible one: Do they possess the competence required to be on time for a train? The answer may surprise you, but — no, actually, it probably won’t.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-19\",\"runtime\":67},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Chapter Two\",\"overview\":\"Our heroes attempt to make the best out of a swampy situation, and race to Rockport before they miss a fateful train. They also meet a beloved radio personality and spokesperson, and hold him ransom for MaxFunDrive donations. Magnus exhibits his upper body strength. Taako gets charming. Merle takes a stink-bath.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-26\",\"runtime\":63},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Chapter Three\",\"overview\":\"Our heroes board their fateful train to Neverwinter, and are rude to just about every single person aboard. Merle strikes out at evangelism. Magnus learns that he may not, in fact, have the biggest muscles. Taako just wrecks some baby carrots.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-15\",\"runtime\":58},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Chapter Four\",\"overview\":\"As you might have guessed from the title of the past few episodes, our heroes’ journey isn’t going to be an especially calm one. Because of all the murder, I mean. Taako mourns the dead. Merle finally plays his part. Magnus does one of the absolute coolest punches ever.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-23\",\"runtime\":55},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Chapter Five\",\"overview\":\"The game is afoot! The game of murder-solving, I mean. The game of Dungeons & Dragons has been afoot for a while. Magnus finds unorthodox uses for furniture. Taako practices his interrogation techinques. Merle becomes a robot mom.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-06\",\"runtime\":56},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Chapter Six\",\"overview\":\"In this penultimate chapter in the Rockport Limited murder fiasco, our players deduce the true culprit of the titular heinous crime. Merle runs out of magic. Taako finds more creative applications for Levitation. Magnus gets some fresh air.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-21\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Chapter Seven\",\"overview\":\"In the final chapter in the Rockport Limited story arc, our heroes have little time to stop their runaway train from colliding with Neverwinter, potentially ruining some other group’s D&D session. Magnus takes a tumble. Merle channels Gary Sinise. Taako does some pretty dope magical stuff.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-03\",\"runtime\":60}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2014-12-03\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}